# The argument is parsed and pushed exactly as the caller's own fallback pushes it (PCMPE +
# EPUSHR: byte-identical), and its static struct is checked: a bare name; a whole free call,
# resolved AFTER the parse (a dedup hit — resolving it first would move a generic's instantiation);
# a whole method / operator result (`_sc_post`'s record); a whole struct-typed field (the passive
# `_fpk` record, parse/decl.cyr). Returns 1 (consumed) only for such a parameter; 0 leaves every
# other one to the caller. All three argument loops reach it. CHANGELOG [6.7.3]
